text = "SCAMLESS is an interactive game designed to help people recognize digital scams in everyday situations.

You'll encounter messages, notifications, links, and payment situations that may look completely normal.

Look for the ‼️ markers - they mark real warning signs scammers use. Your decisions shape your journey.
"
